<title>USA: Tevecap SA Q4 Dec 31 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Tevecap SA Q4 Dec 31 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net   loss		11,164     loss	13,653</p>
<p> Revs			71,209		   32,906</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Net   loss		48,184     loss	41,070</p>
<p> Revs		     211,841		  102,010</p>
<p>(All data above 000s U.S. dollars except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Tevecap said 1995 results have been restated to account for HBO Brasil, which was 33.33 percent owned by Tevecap on an equity basis.</p>
<p>Tevecap, a Brazilian television distribution company, is 56.5 percent owned by Abril, 14.2 percent by Falcon International, 10 percent by Hearst, 10 percent by ABC, and 9.3 percent by CMIF.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
